{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">警方在西九龍打擊違例的士，發出四張交通傳票。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"J.TAXI-0700.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026eYAIdfwRTz1791251542.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"J.TAXI-0700.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">四名的士司機分別涉嫌拒載、駕駛時放多於兩部流動電訊裝置、「冚旗載客」及沒有展示的士司機證。警方指會繼續果斷執法，保障市民及遊客的權益。如發現任何有關的士違法行為，應記下時間、地點、的士車牌、司機姓名及行車路線等資料，並向警方舉報。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"J.TAXI-0700_002.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026IrePqop9bf1791251545.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"J.TAXI-0700_002.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-06T01:59:50.819130+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":138,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}